{"2953620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Conquerors of Fate", "steam_appid": 2953620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Conquerors of Fate</i>, a turn-based strategy game inspired by the classics, where you command formidable Conquerors, build mighty kingdoms, and engage in epic battles. Whether you're exploring vast lands, collecting powerful artifacts, or casting potent spells, every move shapes your path to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from hand-made maps, or play randomly generated ones.  Capture towns, defeat wandering monsters, and collect powerful artifacts.  Expand your kingdom to conquer the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/a17d8f926dde1be4b5a59d3d8a15a37d.poster.avif?t=1775266914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/a17d8f926dde1be4b5a59d3d8a15a37d.webm?t=1775266914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/a17d8f926dde1be4b5a59d3d8a15a37d.mp4?t=1775266914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Kingdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six distinct factions, each with its own unique playstyle, creatures, and strategies. Build up your towns from humble tents up to towering castles.  Recruit a variety of units to help you fight your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/2305c04cb0cb711bb161eb8279dafa88.poster.avif?t=1775266914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/2305c04cb0cb711bb161eb8279dafa88.webm?t=1775266914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/2305c04cb0cb711bb161eb8279dafa88.mp4?t=1775266914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talent Trees and Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your conquerors through their talent trees, unlocking powerful abilities and enhancing synergies between creatures, skills, and spells. This system allows for diverse strategies and adaptability, ensuring no two games are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/fb5ede5fffe5d6384c4f9532112233fa.poster.avif?t=1775266914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/fb5ede5fffe5d6384c4f9532112233fa.webm?t=1775266914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/fb5ede5fffe5d6384c4f9532112233fa.mp4?t=1775266914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in thrilling battles on a classic hexagonal battlefield. With over 75 spells at your disposal and more on the way, plus unique creature abilities, each encounter offers a rich tactical experience. Master the battlefield and turn the tide of combat with strategic brilliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/d04702b42a04a94ce44cf61fb249dec9.poster.avif?t=1775266914\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/d04702b42a04a94ce44cf61fb249dec9.webm?t=1775266914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953620/extras/d04702b42a04a94ce44cf61fb249dec9.mp4?t=1775266914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Player-Friendly Setup</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is completely free to play, with strictly cosmetic micro-transactions ensuring a level playing field. No pay-to-win mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No DRM, with no requirement to be online to play.  Play with others on the same computer via hot-seat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The community is at the heart of <i>Conquerors of Fate</i>.  Your participation helps shape the game into a dynamic and evolving project.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Conquerors of Fate</i> will support English, Russian, and Polish, with potential for additional languages based on community demand.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Conquerors of Fate</i>, a turn-based strategy game inspired by the classics, where you command formidable Conquerors, build mighty kingdoms, and engage in epic battles. Whether you're exploring vast lands, collecting powerful artifacts, or casting potent spells, every move shapes your path to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from hand-made maps, or play randomly generated ones.  Capture towns, defeat wandering monsters, and collect powerful artifacts.  Expand your kingdom to conquer the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"b